      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가폭타를 보지 못한 채로 끝나 버리면\n승부하는 의미가 없잖아!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n다시 한번 승부해 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00D3EDD0C0B97C0020BCF4C9C00020BABBD55C0020CC44B85C0020B05DB0980020BC84B9ACBA74000AC2B9BD80D558B2940020C758BBF8AC000020C5C6C796C544002100100001BE00000AB2E4C2DC0020D55CBC880020C2B9BD80D5740020C918002100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
